---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: "Contact — {{ profile.name }}"
description: "Get in touch with {{ profile.name }}: professional links and contact details."
---

<h1>Contact</h1>
<p class="page-lead">Looking to collaborate, share ideas, or build something meaningful together?</p>

<section class="contact-section">
  <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
  <p>You can reach out through any of my professional channels below. I am always open to discussing new projects, software engineering, product building, and systems architecture.</p>
  
  <div class="contact-info-card" style="margin: 2rem 0; padding: 2rem; background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);">
    <h3 style="margin-top: 0; font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Professional Channels</h3>
    <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.9375rem;">Connect with me directly across my verified public profiles.</p>
    
    <ul class="links-grid">
      {% for link in profile.professionalLinks %}
        <li>
          <a href="{{ link.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <img src="{{ link.icon }}" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy">
            <span>{{ link.label }}</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
